seg-551d44492aae = A line of sight is blocked when it passes inside the body's mean radius (the chord test of the <c1/> kind), and a surface user also needs the elevation mask. At every epoch the run forms the geometric and position dilution of precision (GDOP, PDOP) of the constellation alone, the formal one-sigma position uncertainty with and without the Earth row, and a seeded Gauss-Newton least-squares fix each way, so the report shows what the deep-space link adds.

